Awiy
$cards
DECK 4 SPADES

$initial
DRAW 41 ROTATE 3 U 2
LIBA 2 FACE_ALL
LIBA 5 FACE_ALL
LIBA 2 FACE_ALL
LIBA 2 FACE_ALL

